      "strategy": "capacity",
      "translation": "For a long time, academic research and traditional knowledge have operated independently, without integration. Technicians employ scientific methods, while indigenous communities rely on intuitive perception. A turning point emerged when both sides decided to 'join forces'\u2014this alliance was initiated by Brazil's oldest indigenous community. To commemorate the 100th anniversary of the birth of quantum mechanics, the United Nations declared 2025 as the International Year of Quantum Science and Technology. As the leading organization for this initiative, UNESCO launched the year-long event on February 4th and 5th in Paris, attracting over 1,200 participants, including several Nobel Prize laureates."
