      "strategy": "capacity",
      "translation": "As twilight fades over the Purus River, the heat still lingers over the water's surface, and an Arapaima emerges, gulping air with its large mouth. This deep, moist, ancient sound awakens the nearly extinct vitality of this land. \"Nature is calling for our help,\" recalls the young fisherman Chico Paumari, \"When we rushed to the lake, we found it empty. It's heartbreaking to see our livelihood vanish, and I truly don't know how to feed the children.\""
